# =====================================================================================================
# THE FROZEN MISSION-A SET, stamped 2026-10-14.
#
# The user's instruction: "mission A之前的任务和rviz的地图都保存好，冻结，不搞了" -- mission A and everything
# before it, together with its RViz map, are finished: save them, freeze them, stop working on them.
# Mission B is a NEW world (worlds/forest_b.yaml) with a NEW RViz map (rviz/mission_b.rviz); neither of
# them is listed here, and neither is allowed to change anything below.
#
# WHAT IS FROZEN: the five world files mission A was flown in, the mission/EKF parameter sets it was flown
# with, the RViz view it was watched in, its figures, and the metric dumps that carry its numbers.
# WHAT IS NOT FROZEN: docs/*.md (they are the living record and mission B keeps updating STATUS.md), the
# tools and the flight scripts (mission B fixes bugs in them), and the mission-B artifacts.
#
# HOW TO CHECK: python3 tools/frozen-check.py   -- recomputes every SHA-256 below and names any file that
# moved.  Nothing in this project re-runs a mission-A flight; if a frozen file changes, the mission-A
# numbers in docs/STATUS.md are numbers about a different world, and that is what this manifest refuses to
# let happen silently.
# =====================================================================================================
